discord-native-voice (vendored into crates/relay-voice)

Source:  https://github.com/dolfies/discord-native-voice
Commit:  18bbd204bfe46a781bee37cc8c10d574bdf435dd
Files:   src/transport/{mod,crypto,udp}.rs, src/rtp/mod.rs,
         src/video/{mod,common,h26x,h264,h265,vp8,vp9,av1}.rs and the
         non-pyo3 parts of src/python/{net,transport,video,video_send}.rs.
         Each vendored file starts with a header naming its original path.

